# Install-script allowlist.
#
# Format: <package-name>  # reason
#
# A dependency listed here has been reviewed and its install, preinstall,
# postinstall, prepare, and prepublish lifecycle scripts are known to be
# either absent or safe to run at install time.
#
# As of the 2026-11-08 dependency upgrade, no package in the tree of
# stapes-adsa declares an install, preinstall, or postinstall lifecycle
# script. The entries below are the direct dependencies, each verified
# script-free, so that a future version bump that introduces a lifecycle
# script has to be reviewed deliberately rather than silently accepted.
#
# The transitive tree is verified separately by scanning node_modules for
# any package declaring those scripts. That scan returned no matches.

commander  # CLI argument parser. No lifecycle scripts. MIT.
ts-morph  # TypeScript AST wrapper. No lifecycle scripts. MIT.
typescript  # Compiler. Dev-only. No lifecycle scripts. Apache-2.0.
vitest  # Test runner. Dev-only. No lifecycle scripts. MIT.
@types/node  # Type declarations. Dev-only. No lifecycle scripts. MIT.
minimatch  # Transitive via ts-morph, pinned by overrides. No lifecycle scripts. MIT.
